blished docs produces a chart with no error diagnostics that passes the reader criteria. Recorded as agent rehearsal, not as user evidence. | Scripted rehearsal at each release | D1, 1.2 |\ndocs/02-product-spec.md:286:| Test with screen-reader users, outside developers or design partners before release | One-person project with no participants. Recorded as a stated limit (3.8). Agent rehearsal (DX12) is used and labelled as such; the developer's screen-reader rehearsal (A3) was dropped from 1.0 by the owner and is stated as not done. |\ndocs/02-product-spec.md:289:| Remove the first-chart line-count criterion | Kept as a floor, and joined by DX12, which tests getting it right. |\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
